1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,941
You've turned completely invisible.

2
00:00:02,622 --> 00:00:03,322
First problem,

3
00:00:03,783 --> 00:00:04,443
you're blind.

4
00:00:05,043 --> 00:00:05,544
To see,

5
00:00:05,784 --> 00:00:07,385
your eyes have to catch light.

6
00:00:07,905 --> 00:00:09,747
Invisible eyes let it pass straight

7
00:00:09,787 --> 00:00:10,087
through.

8
00:00:10,847 --> 00:00:11,568
Second problem,

9
00:00:12,008 --> 00:00:13,589
you're not really invisible.

10
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:16,151
Your body bends light like glass,

11
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:18,312
so people see a shimmering outline

12
00:00:18,352 --> 00:00:18,613
of you.

13
00:00:19,113 --> 00:00:20,254
To vanish completely,

14
00:00:20,494 --> 00:00:22,255
you'd have to bend light exactly

15
00:00:22,315 --> 00:00:22,895
like air.

16
00:00:23,596 --> 00:00:24,917
And that sandwich you just ate?

17
00:00:25,497 --> 00:00:26,838
Everyone can watch it float...

18
00:00:27,499 --> 00:00:29,540
and slowly get digested inside you.

19
00:00:30,141 --> 00:00:31,224
Rain makes it worse.

20
00:00:31,785 --> 00:00:33,990
Every drop splashes off your invisible

21
00:00:34,031 --> 00:00:34,351
body.

22
00:00:34,893 --> 00:00:36,176
So you stand still in the

23
00:00:36,216 --> 00:00:36,577
kitchen...

24
00:00:37,158 --> 00:00:38,000
and take another bite.

